          "text": " nkabataataanisisa omuyaga gw'akasooroora omu mahanga goona, agu batakamanyaga. Okwo nikwo ensi ei baatsigireho yaahindukire eihamba, ekabura owaagirabamu naagyenda nari naagaruka; etyo egyo nsi erikukundwa yaahinduka eihamba.",
